{
  "audio_file": "group_4_pair_1_statement1.wav",
  "duration": 69.72,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": 0,
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 7.52,
      "duration": 7.52,
      "text": "The agent perceives, reasons, acts, then perceives again based on the result of that action."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "start": 8.72,
      "end": 13.36,
      "duration": 4.64,
      "text": "That loop is what we call agent-environment interaction."
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "start": 14.14,
      "end": 20.1,
      "duration": 5.96,
      "text": "And it's worth understanding because it's what separates an agent from a static tool."
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "start": 21.0,
      "end": 23.34,
      "duration": 2.34,
      "text": "A static tool waits to be asked."
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "start": 24.02,
      "end": 26.18,
      "duration": 2.16,
      "text": "An agent operates within an environment."
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "start": 26.18,
      "end": 31.68,
      "duration": 5.5,
      "text": "It observes what's happening, decides what action is appropriate, and executes."
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "start": 32.12,
      "end": 35.56,
      "duration": 3.44,
      "text": "Then it checks the result and decides what comes next."
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "start": 37.48,
      "end": 43.78,
      "duration": 6.3,
      "text": "At Solara, an agent monitoring grid performance isn't just waiting for someone to run a report."
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "start": 44.3,
      "end": 45.14,
      "duration": 0.84,
      "text": "It's watching."
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "start": 45.78,
      "end": 53.8,
      "duration": 8.02,
      "text": "When output at a site drops below threshold, it observes the deviation, decides the appropriate"
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "start": 53.8,
      "end": 59.88,
      "duration": 6.08,
      "text": "response, which might be querying historical data, cross-referencing weather records, or"
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "start": 59.88,
      "end": 63.48,
      "duration": 3.6,
      "text": "escalating to a human operator, and takes that action."
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "start": 64.34,
      "end": 66.78,
      "duration": 2.44,
      "text": "The environment shapes the agent."
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "start": 66.78,
      "end": 69.24,
      "duration": 2.46,
      "text": "The agent shapes the environment."
    }
  ],
